  It is possible to use the Voxtral Realtime for turn-taking in speech-to-speech pipelines by training a small MLP head onto its inner decoder layers. While keeping weights frozen, we achieved 0.872 recall at a 509ms latency on the TurnBench dev dataset. The weights are available on Hugging Face, and you can try this model alongside the entire voice pipeline using Speakrail.
